---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="NeuroCapybara collects no personal data: no accounts, no cookies, no tracking.">
  <div class="container page prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Nothing about you leaves your browser</h1>
    <ul>
      <li>There are no accounts, no cookies and no analytics that track individuals.</li>
      <li>Your display settings (theme, text size, motion, sound) are stored in your own browser's local storage, so they are there next time. Clear your browser data to remove them.</li>
      <li>Quiz answers and predictions are never recorded or sent anywhere. They disappear when you leave the page.</li>
      <li>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may keep standard server logs, such as IP addresses, for security; see GitHub's privacy statement.</li>
      <li>Fonts are bundled with the site, so no font service sees your visit.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If this ever changes, this page will say so first.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
